         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Hypermethylation and decreased expression of TMEM240 are potential early-onset biomarkers for colorectal cancer detection, poor prognosis, and early recurrence prediction</rdf:li>
